\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Dn Vs Dlr Early; Slight Depreciation Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Oktober 1998\par 09:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Tuesday, with little movement expected over the session, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0650 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,310 and ROL9,325, up from ROL9,305 and ROL9,320 at Monday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest predicted a very slight depreciation of the leu by the end of the day on pressure from importers' dollar demand. \par \par \uc2  Pressure on the leu decreased late last week after the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , selling dollars to halt falls last Tuesday. Dealers said the bank sold around $30 million when the dollar rose to about ROL9,400. \par \par \uc2  Dealers predict that the leu will continue to depreciate by 3% per month against the dollar until the end of the year, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintaining tight control and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop any major moves. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market last week, attracting leu deposits at high rates in order to divert funds from the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also said that a ROL1.1 trillion Treasury bill auction scheduled for late Tuesday would drain more leu liquidity. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate remained Tuesday at 70%, unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc