\par\par \b \uc2  Romania c. bank sells dollars to support leu. \b0\par\par\uc2 190 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Oktober 1998\par 12:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Oct 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday selling dollars to prevent a sharp depreciation of the national leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said after the BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - in which they said medium amounts of dollars were sold at 9,330/345 to the dollar - the leu had firmed to around 9,310/320. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  forced several banks to correct bids of around 9,330 or even higher," said one dealer with a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  The leu opened on Monday softer at about 9,310/330 to the dollar from Friday's close of 9,300/320 under slight buying pressure from various importers. \par \par \uc2  But some dealers expected the leu to continue to depreciate as importers' hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand was likely to stay high throughout the day. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR's move can only slow down the depreciation but it cannot stop it," another dealer said. ((Andrei Iva, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 312-0264, fax +40 1 315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113dua501966\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
