\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early On Speculative Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 203 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Oktober 1998\par 08:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Friday on speculative moves by banks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0630 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,315 and ROL9,325, from ROL9,280 and ROL9,300 at Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu depreciated early on speculative trading by banks. \par \par \uc2  He predicted the depreciation trend might continue over the session but said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop a major move. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold small amounts of dollars to halt the leu depreciation on Thursday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Leu liquidity is still high even though the money market rates have risen Friday. The overnight money market rate is 40% early Friday from 30% Thursday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu said recently that the leu would depreciate by 1.5% to 2% a month to the end of the year, but in September the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciated by more than 3%. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the depreciation predicted by Isarescu is too optimistic. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0644GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020220dua208k0b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
