\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early On High Leu Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Oktober 1998\par 08:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Thursday on high leu liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0630 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,290 and ROL9,310, from ROL9,270 and ROL9,290 at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu depreciated on increasing dollar demand from banks amid high leu liquidity. \par \par \uc2  A dramatic drop in money market rates in the past days has pushed the banks to look for dollars, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate dropped to less than 10% Wednesday, from 45% Tuesday and more than 100% last week, after banks completed their acquisition of reserves to meet the end-of-month minimum reserve requirements. \par \par \uc2  Thursday, the overnight money market rate is around 30%. \par \par \uc2  The pressure on the leu decreased in early trading Thursday and dealers predict the exchange rate will stabilize. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also predicted the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell dollars to stop a major move. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu said recently that the leu would depreciate by 1.5% to 2% a month to the end of the year, but in September the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciated by 3.48%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 01-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0643GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916dua108gsb\p