\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Seen Depreciating Slightly \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 September 1998\par 09:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Wednesday, with dealers predicting a slight depreciation over the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0645 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,200 and ROL9,220, from ROL9,175 and ROL9,190 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu depreciated on high dollar demand and on a lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  He predicted a further slight depreciation but said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell dollars to stop a major move. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might decide to allow a further depreciation to try to narrow the trade deficit. \par \par \uc2  In the first six months of the year, the trade deficit widened to $1.33 billion from $1.07 billion in the corresponding period of 1997. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu said recently that the leu would depreciate by 1.5% to 2% a month to the end of the year, but dealers said he might have referred to an average depreciation rate. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate dropped to around 25% Wednesday, from 45% Tuesday, after banks completed their acquisition of reserves to meet the end-of-month minimum reserve requirements. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-09-98 \par \par \