\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Calm Session Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 216 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 September 1998\par 08:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Tuesday, with dealers predicting little movement in the Romanian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0645 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,065 and ROL9,085, up from between ROL9,050 and ROL9,080 at Monday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu might stabilize around the current value as dollar demand has decreased. \par \par \uc2  However, he predicted the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt any major depreciation. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for several times, selling dollars to stop the leu's depreciation when the dollar was trading at more than ROL9,100. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold a little more than $35 million. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu said earlier this month that the leu was likely to depreciate by 1% to 2% a month against the dollar until the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the overnight money market rate remained at around 100%, unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2  Low leu liquidity has caused most of the commercial banks to raise interest rates for leu deposits. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzanfx.ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 22-09-98 \par \par \uc2  0651GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9m085kd\par }\page {\pa