\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Weaker Vs Dlr In Early;Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  Thu \b0\par\par\uc2 202 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 September 1998\par 09:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Friday, with National Bank of Romania closely monitoring the market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0700 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,000 and ROL9,010, up from between ROL8,980 and ROL8,990 at Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again Thursday, selling dollars for lei to stop the leu's depreciation as the dollar was trading at more than ROL9,000. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made an identical move on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The dealer predicted the leu may depreciate further on increasing dollar demand from importers. \par \par \uc2  "The pressure (on the leu) will rise after energy imports (rise) for the winter," he said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Mugur Isarescu was quoted by media reports earlier this week as saying that the leu would depreciate by 1%-2% per month against the dollar until the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate dropped Friday to 15%, from about 60% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-09-98 \par \par \uc2  0725GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9407lhn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\pi