\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  Wed \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 1998\par 09:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday, with dealers predicting little change as the National Bank of Romania signaled it won't allow a further depreciation of the home \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0645 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL8,970 and ROL8,990, up from between ROL8,950 and ROL8,970 at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday, selling dollars for lei to stop the leu's depreciation as the dollar was trading at more than ROL9,000. \par \par \uc2  "It was the signal that the leu should stay at its (current) level," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  However, he predicted the market could see temporary fluctuations of the exchange rate, although "any major move will be stopped by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Mugur Isarescu was quoted by media reports Tuesday as saying that the leu would depreciate by 1%-2% per month against the dollar until the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  Romanian Finance Minister Daniel Daianu on Wednesday predicted a monthly inflation for August of between 0.5% to 0.7%, and also said that the government's budget deficit target for 1998 of 3.7% of gross domestic product "is unachievable." \par \par \uc2  He made the comments after a meeting with the International Monetary Fund's chief negotiator for Romania, Poul Thomsen. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate dropped Thursday to 60%, from about 70% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 03-09-98 \par \par \uc2  0723GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9307ju8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
