\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Cen.Bank sells dollars to prop leu. \b0\par\par\uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 1998\par 12:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Sept 2 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday, selling small amounts of dollars to counter a slide of the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR stepped into the market in mid-day trading and sold moderate amounts of money to temper a sharp downswing of the unit," said one dealer from a state-run bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that after the BNR moves, at rates of around 8,975/8,990 to the dollar, the leu firmed to about 8,965/8,975. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slumped at its opening to 8,965/995 to the dollar from Tuesday's close of 8,940/8,955. Dealers said the decline was due to increased hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand coming from players, particularly state-run banks. \par \par \uc2  One dealer said the BNR intended to maintain the leu at a level of about 9,000 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The BNR has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  periodically in recent weeks by selling dollars to cushion the leu's general downward trend. It has also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on money markets by draining leu funds. ((Bucharest Newsroom +40-1 312-0264, fax +40 1 315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du92023u8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
