\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Seen Slipping Slightly \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 1998\par 09:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--Romania's leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Wednesday amid expectations it will slip further in the session, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0710 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL8,980 and ROL9,000, up from between ROL8,940 and ROL8,960 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  "The (leu) depreciation might continue slowly but we won't see any major moves," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. \par \par \uc2  He predicted the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell dollars only to calm down a major depreciation. \par \par \uc2  However, he said the early dip was a result of dollar- buying orders from importers. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen selling dollars at the end of last week, as the dollar was trading for more than ROL9,000. \par \par \uc2  The bank governor, Mugur Isarescu, was quoted by media reports Tuesday as saying that the leu would depreciate by 1-2% per month until the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  Isarescu also said the Russian turmoil has had little effect on Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as portfolio investment in Romania is low. \par \par \uc2  He estimated the flight of investment from Romania as a result of the Russian situation at $60 million. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, the overnight money market rate rose to 70%, from about 45% Tuesday after the government issued ROL 900 billion in six-month T-bills. \par \par \uc2  The annual yield in the oversubscribed auction late Tuesday was 47.92%. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; c