\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Weakens Vs Dlr Early; Seen Depreciating \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 1998\par 09:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday, with dealers predicting a further depreciation of the unit by the end of the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0755 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL8,765 and ROL8,775, up from between ROL8,745 and ROL8,755 at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  "The depreciation will continue. It is what the market is waiting for," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. \par \par \uc2  The leu began depreciating at midsession Wednesday on increased dollar demand from importers, dealers said. The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , buying dollars at ROL8,745. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said there were no major sums, "just a few million dollars," but the the bank's action was seen as a signal that the leu should follow a downward trend. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have often predicted a depreciation of the leu by the end of the year but declined to make an estimate. \par \par \uc2  The current depreciation follows weeks of stability, with the dollar traded at between ROL8,700 and ROL8,750. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the unit was overvalued at those levels. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers predicted the depreciation will be slow, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  preventing any major moves. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates rose to 45% on Thursday, from 40% on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow J