\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Weakens Vs Dlr Early; Little Change Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1998\par 09:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday, with dealers predicting little major change over the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0650 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL8,725 and ROL8,740, up from between ROL8,715 and ROL8,730 at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the unit might depreciate slightly in the next few hours as dollar demand is generally higher in the morning. But, he said the depreciation will be minor. \par \par \uc2  The leu has depreciated each morning this week but returned to initial levels by closing, the dealer said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's National Bank hasn't been seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it was last week. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu suggested he is keen, if anything, to start boosting the country's flagging \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. He said the bank will buy more dollars to meet its 1998 target of $3 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  Some, however, doubt the target will be hit. \par \par \uc2  "The estimation is not realistic," said another dealer. "Romania's economy is not in such a good shape to allow the $3 billion reserves." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves at the end of June totaled $2.43 billion, down from $2.52 billion a month earlier. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate fell to 25% Thursday, from 45% Wednesday as banks has completed their end-month minimum reserve requirements. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-07-98 \par \par \uc2  0716GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du7u06iv5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
