\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Romania C.Bank confident, cabinet debates reforms. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mirela Eremia \par \uc2 581 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 1998\par 19:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, July 24 (Reuters) - Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) on Friday said a lower discount rate and new rules on reserves reflected confidence in economic trends while the cabinet debated for the second straight day how to speed up reforms. \par \par \uc2  The BNR statement, issued two days after the changes were first leaked, said that a cut in the discount rate to 35 from 40 percent, valid August 1, showed its belief that inflation had been tamed. \par \par \uc2  It also gave a signal to relaunch lending activity after months of contraction in line with Romania's recession. \par \par \uc2  The statement said the new rules aimed to "direct money supply and interest rates in line with inflation. Meanwhile, a positive signal has been given to relaunch credit activity." \par \par \uc2  Monthly inflation fell to 1.3 percent in June from a peak of 7.2 percent in February. Officials put the average monthly inflation rate at between 1.7 to two percent by the year's end. \par \par \uc2  Inflation remains one of the few bright spots in Romania's economic outlook, with investors and Western lenders demanding faster action on long-delayed privatisation and restructuring of top-heavy industry left over from communist times. \par \par \uc2  At the government headquarters, Prime Minister Radu Vasile and his cabinet were debating for the second consecutive evening how to put utilities and other large enterprises more quickly into private hands. \par \par \uc2  Ministers were to approve the restructuring of Romgaz gas authority and a fund to protect farmers' incomes, which were threatened by wheat imports from more efficient neighbouring markets. \par \par \uc2  Vasile, appointed in April to end months of debilitating rows within the cabinet, blamed both his privatisation and finance ministers for slow progress with reforms and demanded measures to bring in more budget revenue. \par \par \uc2  The BNR circular notice sent to banks on Wednesday also announced that the Lombard rate of 140 percent would be replaced with a marginal rate of 95 percent starting August 1. \par \par \uc2  Under the new reserve requirements rules, the minimum reserve rate on leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose to 15 from 12.5 percent, and the rate on hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds fell to 15 from 20 percent. \par \par \uc2  The BNR also set a minimum daily reserve target ratio at 40 percent and a maximum ratio at 130 percent. \par \par \uc2  The statement said the rules were part of a boader package of regulations aimed at improving the functioning of the money market. They followed new banking laws adopted earlier in the year to align Romania legislation to Western standards. \par \par \uc2  Dealers earlier said the BNR was trying to tighten control of liquidity and temper volatility on the money markets. Rate cuts, they said, were aimed at adjusting for lower inflation and would offset minimum reserve revision. \par \par \uc2  The money market has been subject to large shifts of prices in the course of any given month, with banks chasing leu funds ahead of the month's end to meet reserves. Prices peaked at 150 percent before diving to 20 at the start of the month. \par \par \uc2  The BNR has been keeping a tight grip on the markets in recent months, checking leu liquidity by soaking up deposits from banks or selling dollars to cushion the leu's slide. It has used both tolls in repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  got a boost on Friday when the European Union's investment arm, the European Investment Bank, extended a 20-year loan worth $249 million to rebuild roads. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du7o004l3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
