\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Weakens Against Dollar In Early Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 1998\par 10:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) declined against the dollar early Wednesday as demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained strong but supplies dwindled. \par \par \uc2  At 0715 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL8,740 and ROL8,755, up from between ROL8,730 and ROL8,740 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the amount of dollars on offer, together with a continuous demand for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from importers, have pushed the leu down. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday to slow the leu's depreciation. \par \par \uc2  The dealer suggested that the leu also wasn't being helped by ROL1 trillion of oversubscribed Treasury bills auctions late Tuesday. He said that investors who had failed to get their bill allocations were now looking to buy dollars instead. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer predicted the leu's depreciation could continue for the rest of the week. However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and stop any major fall. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity remained high in early trading Wednesday as banks have already completed their end-month minimum reserves and are not interested in attracting more deposits, dealers reported. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate remained 20% annually, the same rate as Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 22-07-98 \par \par \uc2  0803GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du7m066ua\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
