\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Steadies Vs Dollar Early After T-Bill Auction \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juli 1998\par 09:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--Romania's leu (ROL) is steady against the dollar early Wednesday as a Treasury bill auction has drained lei liquidity. Dealers predict no major changes over the session. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading between ROL8,680 and ROL8,700 at 0650 GMT Wednesday, unchanged from its closing Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  However, the unit depreciated Tuesday after opening at between ROL8,655 and ROL8,685. \par \par \uc2  "Some buying orders from importers and the high liquidity have pushed the leu up," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. \par \par \uc2  A ROL1.2 T-bill auction issued by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  late Tuesday has drained lei from the market, the dealer said, and the pressure on the leu is expected to relax. \par \par \uc2  The auction was oversubscribed and the annual yield went up to 43.86% from 35.01% in the previous auction last week. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday to stem the depreciation but has been closely monitoring the market. \par \par \uc2  He predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't allow a major depreciation of the unit over a short amount of time. The leu dropped 1.2% last week. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rates went up Wednesday to 20% annually, after 5% Tuesday and 110% last week. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan, 401-210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 01-07-98 \par \par \uc2  0740GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dj