\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to ease pressure on leu. \b0\par\par\uc2 213 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, March 25 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \par \par \uc2  sold dollars on the interbank market at midday on Wednesday to \par \par \uc2  ease pressure on the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR sold dollars to offer support to the leu which was \par \par \uc2  hovering at about 8,490/530," said one trader, adding that the \par \par \uc2  size of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have been around $10 million. \par \par \uc2  "I don't know exactly why the BNR stepped in but it might \par \par \uc2  want to see some firmer prices," said another. \par \par \uc2  The leu firmed towards 8,330/445 following BNR moves. \par \par \uc2  The BNR \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday \par \par \uc2  after the leu dipped to about 8,500/600 to the dollar from \par \par \uc2  around 8,250/350 at last Friday's close and quotes near 8,055 a \par \par \uc2  week ago. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said higher dollar demand in recent days came from \par \par \uc2  some repatriation of fixed income investments and on the back of \par \par \uc2  a cash-heavy money market. \par \par \uc2  Some players said the BNR tried to drain some leu funds from \par \par \uc2  the money market, where rates were now at 75/80 percent. \par \par \uc2  ((Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom +40-1 312-0264, fax +40 1 \par \par \uc2  315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du3p08mhr\par }\page {\pa