\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Steady Early But Some Appreciation Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 08:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--Romania's leu (ROL) is steady early Friday but dealers predict some appreciation later in the day as state banks sell some dollars to pay lei debts. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading between ROL8,050 and ROL8,080, at 0720 GMT Friday, from between ROL8,060 and ROL8,100 at closing Thursday. \par \par \uc2  'There won't be much volume (Friday) but some state banks are selling enough dollars that the leu (will strengthen),' said one dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. \par \par \uc2  He predicted no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite steady appreciation of the leu in recent weeks, amid high inflation. \par \par \uc2  'I think they're waiting until the budget is presented and this political situation ends,' said the dealer. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the government is expected to finish the budget draft Sunday or Monday and present it to Parliament next week. \par \par \uc2  Several government-allied and opposition politicians vow to vote against the budget unless Prime Minister Victor Ciorbea first resigns. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The crisis started at the beginning of the year and, say local\par dealers, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has occasionally \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to strengthen the\par leu despite government pledges that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will depreciate in line\par with inflation.\par     -By Adam Brown (401)210-8197 adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 13-03-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0732GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du3d027z2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
