\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA \highlight\uc2  LEU WEAKER, MKT AWAITS C.BANK  \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Februar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  0825 GMT - The Romanian leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened to about \par \par \uc2  8,350/450 to the dollar on Monday from around 8,330/400 at \par \par \uc2  Friday's close, with hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand on the rise and \par \par \uc2  dealers awaiting \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said quarrels ravaging the coalition government \par \par \uc2  over the weekend, despite an agreement to rehaspe the coalition \par \par \uc2  after Social Democrats withdrew their ministers from the \par \par \uc2  cabinet, had little impact on the market. \par \par \uc2  * Traders said the BNR was expected to soak up fresh funds \par \par \uc2  from the money market and extend maturities of deposits taken \par \par \uc2  last month, as short-term prices fell towards 100/110 percent \par \par \uc2  from Friday's 140/150 percent amid increased liquidity. \par \par \uc2  * Operators said they expected the BNR to act again on the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market where higher dollar buying notes from \par \par \uc2  clients was putting the leu under pressure. \par \par \uc2  "I think the BNR will sell dollars if bid prices go below \par \par \uc2  8,400," said one trader. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said they had noticed an increase in volumes \par \par \uc2  with individuals after Romania introduced on Friday new rules \par \par \uc2  to lift the $500 annual limit on Romanians' hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  purchases, in line with the IMF \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  convertibility norms. \par \par \uc2  "Many are still pondering on whether to buy dollars or put \par \par \uc2  their savings in banks which raised interest rates," one said. \par \par \uc2  * On the retail market, the leu opened trading between \par \par \uc2  8,250/550 to 8,400/650 to the dollar, almost unchanged from \par \par \uc2  about 8,350/550 over the weekend. \par \par \uc2  ((Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom +40-1 312-0264, fax +40 1 \par \par \uc2  315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040130du2200t3g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
