\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Stable As Dealers Predict  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 1998\par 09:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu is trading stable early Friday as dealers said they were confident that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  will offset rising pressure on the leu from political instability. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at between 8,410 lei (ROL) and ROL8,460 at 0740 GMT Friday, the same as Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has made it clear that they want the dollar at ROL8,400,' said one dealer. 'If it starts to go above that, they're going to come to us with dollars.' \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has strengthened the leu from between ROL8,450 and ROL8,500 to the dollar at opening Thursday despite a rift in the ruling coalition that threatens to topple the government. \par \par \uc2  As reported, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Policy Director Ion Dragolin said Thursday the bank has sold $100 million in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves since Jan. 6 when rumors of a political crisis started to hit markets. \par \par \uc2  Romania's Democratic Party, the second largest in the four-member coalition, is demanding resignation of the entire government in order to speed up economic reform. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par If the government doesn't resign, the party said it will abandon the\par coalition and leave the government with a minority parliament.\par -By Adam Brown (401)210-8197 adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0816GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1g00dmw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
