\par\par \b \uc2  Exotic  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2 /Romania -3: Crisis Began In December \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 1998\par 12:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'If they don't get anything done this year, foreign debt payments, interest and principal, will probably rise to $2 billion (in 1999),' said Shtereva. \par \par \uc2  She said the political instability will also make it more difficult for \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  to obtain credit abroad. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  repeatedly in early January to counter rising dollar demand from importers. A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman also accused foreign banks of speculating against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the crisis within the ruling coalition grew. \par \par \uc2  The current political crisis began in late December when former Transport Minister Traian Basescu sharply criticized the pace of economic reform and then resigned under pressure from Ciorbea. \par \par \uc2  Basescu's PD threatened to withdraw from the coalition to back demands for his reinstatement but Ciorbea said he would never again accept Basescu as a minister. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, Basescu said he didn't want the job back and the PD's Wednesday vote turned into a yes or no vote on approval of the government. The PD national council voted 444 in favor of demanding the government's resignation while 12 voted against and six abstained. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is trading between 8,410 and 8,490 lei, up from between 8,250 and 8,300 lei at the beginning of the year. \par \par \uc2  Despite its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the leu, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman said \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves are currently around $2.6 billion, roughly the same level the last two months but up from $700 million one year ago. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 15-01-98 \par \par \uc2  1152GMT \par \par \uc2  1106 1838 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1f00e6l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
