\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Importer Association Says Importer Dlr Demand Low \b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Januar 1998\par 13:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--Romania's National Association of Importers and Exporters Monday blamed speculators for weakening the leu over the last week and denied importer dollar buying had a significant effect on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In a press release Monday, association President Mihai Ionescu said imports, traditionally high in January, are considerably lower this month than last January and importer dollar demand has had only moderate effect on the leu. \par \par \uc2  Ionescu, who couldn't be immediately reached for comment, said in the press release that 'certain players' sparked a speculative attack on the leu 'at the first sign of an increase' in the dollar rate. \par \par \uc2  The press release also blamed the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  for not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets last Thursday or Friday. \par \par \uc2  As reported, \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $10 million daily in the first three days of last week but refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the end of the week. \par \par \uc2  The statement comes after local media cited the National Bank of Romania blaming foreign bank speculation for weakening the leu last week. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the leu has depreciated to between 8,480 and 8,570 per dollar Monday afternoon from between 8,250 and 8,300 per dollar a week earlier. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dealers say increased dollar demand from importers,\par particularly oil buyers, has weakened the leu.\par -By Adam Brown (401)-210-8197 adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 12-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1200GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1c0091v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
