\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Weakening As Dealers See Large  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 1998\par 09:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu weakened sharply in early trading Friday as dealers predicted large-scale \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the early afternoon. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading between 8,400 and 8,450 lei on the interbank market at 0745 GMT, from between 8,350 and 8,400 at closing Thursday. The leu is down from between 8,220 and 8,280 at Thursday's opening amid a surge of dollar buying from importers, said dealers. \par \par \uc2  One dealer with a foreign bank said some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators may be adding pressure on the leu but predicted Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will sell as much as $20 million between 1100 GMT and 1200 GMT Friday. \par \par \uc2  As reported, dealers say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $10 million per day in the first three days of the week but abstained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  'The rate is way too high,' said a dealer. 'I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is going to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a big way. They'll put the leu back up to 7,300 (per dollar).' \par \par \uc2  He also predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could also borrow several hundred lei from the interbank market to help halt the leu's slide. \par \par \uc2  After daily \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  borrowing early in the week, money market rates are at about 85%, for overnight, from about 65% shortly afterning Monday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers say the high money market rates will also drive up the yield\par on an auction of 643 billion lei in three-month Treasury bills scheduled\par for next Tuesday.\par -By Adam Brown; (401)210-8197; adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 09-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0824GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du190075t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
