\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Weakening Early As Further  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 1998\par 10:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu is weakening in early trading as large dollar purchases by oil importers offset dollar sales and a liquidity drain by the National Bank of Romania, said dealers. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading between 8,230 and 8,280 lei at 0830 GMT, from between 8,100 and 8,150 lei per dollar at closing Tuesday after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'Oil importers still have some huge (dollar) orders out there and the pressure isn't off the leu yet,' said one dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. He predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again Wednesday, definitely by draining lei from the market but possibly through dollar sales as well. \par \par \uc2  'I don't think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is happy with (\b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) rates above 8,200 (lei per dollar),' said the dealer. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  borrowed more than 100 billion lei Tuesday at overnight rates as high as 80% annually and sold up to $10 million to counter a sharp weakening of the leu in late morning. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said an auction late Tuesday of 642 billion lei in three-month Treasury bills didn't drain enough liquidity to stabilize the leu. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He said money market rates are at about 70% for overnight, down from\par peak rates of 80% Tuesday afternoon but up from 65% at Tuesday's\par opening.\par -By Adam Brown (401)210-8197 adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 07-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0920GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du170043r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
