\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Steady As Traders Await Large T-Bill Auction \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 1998\par 09:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--Romania's leu is trading stable in low volumes early Tuesday as dealers predicted an afternoon Treasury bill auction will reduce excess lei liquidity. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading between 8,250 and 8,300 lei on the interbank market Tuesday at 0745 GMT, the same as closing Monday. \par \par \uc2  'There's a lot of lei liquidity on the market, but the T-bill auction should be enough to drain it,' said one dealer with a foreign bank. 'If it isn't, the (National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will probably \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on money markets.' \par \par \uc2  The amount of Tuesday's three-month T-bill auction is 643 billion lei, from about 400 billion lei in a late December auction and an average of 200 billion lei per auction in recent months. \par \par \uc2  He said excess lei liquidity has driven down overnight lending rates to as low as 65% annually from close to 70% Monday and a high of 120% in late December when the Christmas season sparked a lei shortage. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer with a foreign bank predicted Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will resume regular dollar purchases later this week after draining lei from the market. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 'They haven't been able to buy dollars for a while without affecting\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates,' he said. 'Pretty soon, they'll be wanting to increase\par (\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves).'\par -By Adam Brown (401)210-8197 adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 06-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0823GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du16002g3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
