\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA \highlight\uc2  CEN.BANK  \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENES \highlight\uc2  TO TEMPER LEU FALL. \b0\par\par\uc2 213 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Jan 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) sold dollars on the local interbank market and soaked up money market funds to ease a downswing of the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said on Monday. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR entered the market selling dollars after the leu had fallen to bid quotes of 8,300," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  "It was also active on the money market draining one-week funds at prices near 85 percent," said another trader. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the size of the BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was not the largest over the past months but they qualified it as "significant". \par \par \uc2  Over the past months the BNR had repeatedly stepped into the interbank market, selling and buying dollars in a bid to check the leu's trend. \par \par \uc2  Some operators said its largest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market had been felt in October. \par \par \uc2  The leu traded firmer between 8,150 and 8,200 to the dollar after the BNR \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , compared to an opening of about 8,230/290. Dealers said the leu came under pressure due to an overliquid money market and a pickup in dollar demand. ((Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom +40-1 312-0264)) REUTERS \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040130du1500gja\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
