\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  leu holds level amid c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Dec 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu ended on Friday at about 7,925/970 to the dollar, near Thursday's closing, getting support from small-scale \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR took some action but the amounts were smaller and the moves more tempered compared with Thursday," said one dealer. "They seemed poised to pinch players with bid quotes weaker than 7,930." \par \par \uc2  Operators said the BNR was also acting on the money market side, helping short-term prices to recover at close towards 70/80 percent after easing towards 55/70 percent at midday on the back of a high leu liquidity. \par \par \uc2  "It is very clear the BNR wants to use the exchange rate as an anchor for inflation," said one trader. "But fundamentals, including current account deficit, demand a depreciation." \par \par \uc2  "I think they won't let the leu slide below 8,100 by the year's end," said another. \par \par \uc2  Over the past few days the BNR had intensified a campaign to ease increased pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  triggered by some repatriation of earnings from the capital markets and rising imports ahead of Christmas holidays. \par \par \uc2  Its largest moves occurred on Thursday, when it sold dollars and drained money market funds, managing to avert a downswing of the leu after ask prices dipped towards 8,015. \par \par \uc2  At licensed money changing bureaux the leu lingered near 8,100/200 to the dollar over the past week. ((Mirela Eremia, Bucharest newsroom +40 1 312-0264)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtc501eo5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
