\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Weakens On Importer Demand;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 1997\par 09:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu is weakening further in early trading Thursday as dealers predict further National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ease the slide triggered by dollar demand by importers. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading between 7,980 lei and 8,015 lei on the interbank market at 0745 GMT (09:45 AM local time), up from between 7,950 and 7,985 at closing Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  'One or two state banks are buying huge amounts of dollars from other banks for importers,' said one dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. 'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again.' \par \par \uc2  As reported, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold more than $10 million at about 11:30 AM local time Wednesday and continued selling small amounts of dollars throughout the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  'They (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) came to me four times with $1 million each time,' said another dealer with a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the largest since mid-October, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $47.5 million. \par \par \uc2  The leu has weakened sharply since Tuesday, the beginning of the trading week, when it traded between 7,850 and 7,900 lei per dollar. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The dealer said virtually all the pressure stems from dollar buying by\par importers. One dealer said a Tuesday issue of 643 billion lei in\par three-month T-bills, more than twice the normal size of the weekly\par auctions, still didn't take enough lei off the markets to affect \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates.\par -By Adam Brown (401)210-8197 adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0812GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtc409a28\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
