\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS - ROMANIA C.BANK ACTS TO CUSHION LEU DOWNSWING. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mirela Eremia \par \uc2 436 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Dec 4 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local interbank market on Thursday, selling dollars and draining money market funds to cushion a downswing of the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The BNR moves intensified a campaign in recent days to offset increased pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The leu is faced with larger hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases from imports and some repatriation of capital market gains," said one dealer. \par \par \uc2  "A rise in leu liquidity at the beginning of the month also hit the leu's relative stability," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Most players said market trends were unaffected by a vote in parliament to approve changes in Prime Minister Victor Ciorbea's reshuffled cabinet aimed at rejuvenating reforms. \par \par \uc2  The leu recovered to near 7,920/970 to the dollar at midday from around 7,970/8,015 at Thursday's open, but remained weaker against last Friday's levels of 7,880/910. Short-term prices dipped to around 60/90 percent from 100/120 percent in early trading on Wednesday amid a cash-heavy money market. \par \par \uc2  Leu-dollar retail prices, generally more sensitive, remained relatively stable at 8,100/8,200. \par \par \uc2  The BNR acknowledged this week it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in recent days, both selling and buying dollars to avoid undermining reserve money targets. \par \par \uc2  But officials said the bank was a net purchaser of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  last month, boosting its total \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to 2.69 billion from end-October's 2.52 billion. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the BNR seemed ready to continue to step into the market. "Maybe the BNR is willing to prepare us for the launch of the new \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rules and is trying to show it has guts to resist pressure," one trader said. h nearly doubled to 6.5 percent in October from the previous month. \par \par \uc2  Ciorbea said on Thursday the increase in the inflation rate was a temporary phenomenon and suggested it would stand somewhere below five percent in November. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said monthly inflation was likely to stay at about five percent in November and December as slow structural reforms were undermining this year's macro-stabilisation gains. \par \par \uc2  Traders said year-end bonuses and higher energy and transport prices were keeping inflationary expectations high, especially for December. \par \par \uc2  Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was relatively calm in November, with hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases from clients at 440 million and sales at 436 million. The leu saw a gradual fall of about 1.4 percent after a similar slide in October. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040131dtc4010ja\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
