\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Weakens Early As Dealers See  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 1997\par 10:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu weakened in early trading Wednesday in high dollar buying despite increased confidence in the government after Tuesday's cabinet shuffle, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at between 7,960 and 7,980 lei at 0800 GMT up from between 7,910 and 7,940 lei at closing Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'Dollar demand is high from a lot of sources,' said one dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. 'I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is going to sell some dollars in the afternoon and the rate going to go down by (Thursday).' \par \par \uc2  The dealer maintained his prediction of a year-end rate of 8,200 lei per dollar. \par \par \uc2  The leu has depreciated rapidly since last Thursday when it opened between 7,820 and 7,850 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dealers cite high dollar buying by importers and some repatriation of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from local markets. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  actually supports the depreciation as it is planning to soon adopt Article VIII of the International Monetary Fund charter on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  convertibility. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 'The leu is overvalued and the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  wanted to take out some of\par the value first,' he said. He predicted the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will adopt\par Article VIII this month after three months of steady delays.\par -By Adam Brown; +401 210-8197; adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0903GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtc3098ry\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
