\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Weakens Early; Dealers Expect  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 1997\par 09:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu is weakening in early trading Tuesday as dealers predict rising dollar demand will force \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  by mid-afternoon. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading between 7,905 and 7,930 at 10:15 local time (0815 GMT), up from between 7,850 and 7,900 at closing on Friday. \par \par \uc2  'Dollar demand is up from all sides,' said one dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. 'If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the leu will be around 7,950 to 7,980 at the end of the day.' \par \par \uc2  The dealer said some repatriation of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from capital markets, plus rising dollar demand from importers and other sources, is sparking the latest round of pressure on the leu that started last Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sale of several million dollars Thursday, the leu has weakened from between 7,800 and 7,830 per dollar at Thursday's opening. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will sell several million dollars again Monday, allowing the leu to depreciate only slightly. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said the leu will depreciate in line with inflation. Monthly inflation in October jumped to 6.5% from 3.3% in September. And \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said it dropped only slightly in November. \par \par \uc2  -By Adam Brown (401)210-8197 adam@mail.kappa.ro \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0842GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtc2096tz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
