\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Weakens As Dealers Await T-Bill Auction \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 November 1997\par 08:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (AP-Dow Jones)--Romania's leu is weakening slightly in early trading Tuesday as importers increased dollar purchases to stock up for winter, said dealers. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading between 7,820 and 7,850 lei at 09:30 local time (0730 GMT), from between 7,800 and 7,830 lei at closing Monday. \par \par \uc2  One dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said importers are buying more dollars to pay off year-end invoices and increase dollar supplies for winter, when energy importers increase purchases and imports rise before the Christmas gift-buying season. \par \par \uc2  But he said an auction of 250 billion lei in three-month Treasury bills Tuesday afternoon should prevent repatriation of foreign investment from the T-bill market. \par \par \uc2  As reported, many foreign investors withdrew dollars from Romania after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  canceled five of the last seven T-bill auctions. On Monday, the ministry announced an increase in the size of Tuesday's afternoon auction to 250 billion lei from 200 billion lei. \par \par \uc2  Another trader predicted the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  falls further but rather will wait for the results of the T-bill auction. \par \par \uc2  Money market rates currently exceed 60%, at overnight, from 52% a week ago. And traders say the yield on T-bills Tuesday may rise above 60%. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The dealer said the rate determines the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's willingness to\par continue its recent \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on money markets.\par -By Adam Brown;401-210-8197; adam@mail.kappa.ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 11-11-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0752GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbb08jkz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
