\par\par \b \uc2  Romania c.bank sells dlrs to prop up leu-dealers. \b0\par\par\uc2 201 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Oct 7 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday, selling dollars and draining money market funds to contain the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR sold quite large amounts of dollars," said one. \par \par \uc2  The leu recovered immediately after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to about 7,660/740 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  A surge in dollar demand had pushed it down in early trading to 7,740/850 against Monday's closing quotes of about 7,720/770. \par \par \uc2  BNR officials were not immediately available for comment. \par \par \uc2  Traders also said the BNR drained leu funds from the money market to prevent a drop in rates due to a rise in liquidity. \par \par \uc2  The BNR has repeatedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local markets in the past weeks aiming to calm down increased pressure from rising dollar demand ahead of the winter period and to prevent sharp moves of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has previously pledged to continue cautious policies aimed to prevent a firming up of the leu while seeking to keep the unit competitive for exporters. \par \par \uc2  -- Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011001dta701lhi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pi