\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  leu ends weaker despite c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 374 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Sept 26 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu ended lower at about 7,600/645 to the dollar on Friday against opening quotes of around 7,560/630 despite \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) moves to sell dollars and temper a midday downswing, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR sold dollars to all players who had bid quotes weaker than 7,600," said one trader. \par \par \uc2  The leu managed a slight recovery in afternoon trading after the BNR \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but eased back to weaker quotes at close, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Most said the leu's trend for next week depended on the BNR's further moves in the coming days, when pressure on the unit might emerge from an expected rise in leu liquidity and larger dollar buying orders from importers. \par \par \uc2  "Leu liquidity may rise with the start of a new month and following the cancellation of the treasury bill issue," said one trader, adding that the BNR might again mop up funds from the money market to keep the leu attractive. \par \par \uc2  Earlier in the day, the Finance Ministry said it cancelled a rollover issue worth 309.16 billion lei in six-month treasury bills due to cover papers maturing next week. It declined to say whether the other four issues of 91-day T-bills planned for next month would also be annulled. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the BNR had refrained on Friday from draining leu funds as it had done in recent days to back the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Its previous moves on the money market imposed a rise in short-term prices, which traded now from 45 to 48 percent. \par \par \uc2  Other operators said the BNR might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again by selling hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank market if higher dollar demand pushed the leu sharply down. They said the BNR's aim was to avoid large fluctuations in the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  BNR officials have pledged cautious policies to keep the unit competitive for exporters. \par \par \uc2  Local bankers said the BNR seemed to favour a gradual slide of the leu against the dollar, monitoring the market to prevent sharp moves and seeking to keep its reserves on target. Reserves are currently estimated at $2.3 billion. -- Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011001dt9q01vbi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
