\par\par \b \uc2  ROMANIA C.BANK SELLS DLRS TO PROP UP LEU  \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Sept 26 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday, selling dollars to stop a downswing of the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  The leu weakened to about 7,610/680 to the dollar at midday from opening quotes of around 7,560/630. Traders said the BNR sold small amounts, pushing the leu back to 7,580/620 in afternoon trading. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the BNR had refrained so far from mopping leu funds from the money market as it did over the past days when it backed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and imposed a rise in short-term prices. \par \par \uc2  The BNR also sold dollars earlier this week when the leu fell sharply in a single day to around 7,710/770. The bank managed to stop its rapid depreciation due to rising dollar demand ahead of the winter period. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has previously pledged to continue prudential policies aimed to prevent a firming up of the leu while seeking to keep the unit competitive for exporters. \par \par \uc2  Local bankers said the BNR seemed to favour a gradual easing of the leu against the dollar, monitoring the market to prevent sharp moves of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -- Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040131dt9q00hub\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
