\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Strengthens -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Now Seen Unlikely \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 September 1997\par 14:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Traders said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , expected late Wednesday morning, is now unlikely before markets close at 15:30 local time (12:30 GMT). \par \par \uc2  Increased dollar purchasing from the state oil importer Petrol Export-Import and private exchange houses in Romania sparked the leu depreciation in the last few days, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The leu reached opening Wednesday levels from between 7,525 and 7,575 lei per dollar on Friday. \par \par \uc2  But another trader with a western European bank said the state oil importer was only seeking to buy $700,000 on the interbank market Wednesday after accumulating more than $40 million in recent days. \par \par \uc2  'I think they have enough dollars for a while,' said the trader. The trader added that private exchange houses also slowed dollar purchases Wednesday after a buying spurt on Monday and Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said exchange houses bought large amounts of dollars recently as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  prepares to enact legislation in October allowing Romanian citizens to buy as much hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as they want. \par \par \uc2  Currently, Romanians can buy a maximum of $500 per year in hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Another trader with a foreign bank said several foreign investors also\par bought dollars to repatriate funds in the last few days after a June\par issue of 600 billion lei in Treasury bills expired.\par     -By Adam Brown\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-09-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1216GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9o076zg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
