\par\par \b \uc2  Romania c.bank sells dlrs to contain leu fall. \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Sept 23 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in late trading on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday, selling dollars to contain a rapid downswing of the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  The leu slumped to 7,710/770 to the dollar in early trading from quotes of 7,640/700 on Monday. It bounced back to Monday's levels at the closing after the BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders said the BNR also drained leu funds to offer the leu further support by generating shortages on the money market and imposing an upward move in short-term prices. \par \par \uc2  Short-term money market prices ended up near 40 percent on overnight funds and at about 44 percent for one week against previous rates ranging between 38 to 40 percent. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the leu's fall has been prompted by larger dollar buying orders from importers and a low supply of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as foreign investors in Romanian stocks had been on the sidelines in recent weeks. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials were not immediately available for comment. Traders were reluctant to give the size of the BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Most dealers said they expected the leu to stabilise after Tuesday's sharp fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  -- Mirela Eremia, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011001dt9n025s4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
