\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 ROMANIA \highlight\uc2  CEN BANK  \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENES \highlight\uc2  TO KEEP LEU LOW. \b0\par\par\uc2 366 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, May 28 (Reuter) - Operators on Romania's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market said on Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the leu from appreciating after standing at 7,050/90 to the dollar for days. \par \par \uc2  "We are certain that the National Bank bank has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bought large amounts of dollars," one dealer with a private bank said. \par \par \uc2  The leu closed the day weaker at 7,120/180 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "It is clear that their (BNR) action is meant to prevent the leu from firming." the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  BNR spokesman Mugur Stet denied any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the bank saying Wednesday's dollar purchases had been in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy to build up reserves. \par \par \uc2  "I admit we bought fairly large amounts of dollars over the past weeks," Stet told Reuters. "We had to buy because the market started being flooded with hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from portfolio investors to the capital market. So we had to take action," he said. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, Prime Minister Victor Ciorbea said the BNR's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves stood at $1.6 billion, double the level recorded in February. \par \par \uc2  However, operators said on Wednesday the BNR had placed buying orders with a firm quotation by mid-day, departing from the "regular" pattern of late trading deals, usually with banks with long positions. \par \par \uc2  "There is no doubt that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought a record amount of dollars from many banks today. It might be a signal to exporters," said another operator. \par \par \uc2  But dealers declined to elaborate on the range of BNR bids. \par \par \uc2  The daily Curierul National quoted BNR governor Mugur Isarescu as saying excess dollars on the market, amid a lower demand for credits, could prompt the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to drain the surplus and prevent the leu from firming. \par \par \uc2  Analysts warned a firmer leu could have a negative impact on reforms, affecting mainly exports and restructuring. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, dealers also said a T-bill issue worth 82 billion lei had not been sufficient to drain leu funds from the money market, in the absence of other banking instruments to mop up the excess. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040130dt5s017qz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
