\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Steady -2: NBR  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 April 1997\par 09:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Another trader predicted that the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in the next week or two to boost the dollar. \par \par \uc2  'The rate is hurting exporters, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is clearly not satisfied,' he said. \par \par \uc2  Another trader predicted earlier that the dollar could rise as far as 8,000 lei in the next two weeks if the NBR \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, he said, the bank is buying small amounts of dollars regularly, taking advantage of the low dollar rate to boost foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, now about $900 million. \par \par \uc2  The NBR has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets twice since it changed trading rules to permit all 28 foreign and domestic banks in Romania to trade dollars. \par \par \uc2  Previously, just four banks - with close government ties - had been permitted to trade dollars. \par \par \uc2  The first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , about six weeks ago, was aimed at boosting the leu. In the second two weeks later, the NBR bought an estimated $5 million to $10 million to drive the leu down by about 8%. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With daily turnover in Romanian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets averaging $20\par million, traders said a $5 million purchase would be enough to drive the\par dollar up to 7,500 lei.\par     --Adam Brown\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-04-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0730GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4g02pqn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
